    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the report. The issue originates from the exception hierarchy, which for the first time requires us to do type checks for types that are not directly referenced in the code. `KeyError` and `IndexError` are both `LookupError`s, so that's what we infer as result, but it's not named anywhere so the code needed to use that type isn't automatically included.\n\nI'll look into it.",
